{"message":"Add Rust/WASM port of resemble-enhance inference pipeline\n\nPorts denoiser UNet, IRMAE autoencoder, CFM WaveNet+ODE solver, and\nUniVNet vocoder (with location-variable convolution and alias-free\nactivations) to Rust via candle, compiled to wasm32 for browser\ninference. Includes a Python weight-conversion pipeline verified\nagainst the real pretrained checkpoint, and a browser-witnessed WASM\nbuild.","session_id":null}
